    "LIVE01 and LIVE03 baseline reported cold Telem cache while treatment reported warm; no latency or monetary saving is inferred. Direct Tavily cache freshness is unknown.",
    "All six prepared live executions are initial builds, not paired selective custom-board refreshes. Each strategy used three model calls, three queries and three source-page fetches in aggregate.",
    "The immutable evaluator retains page/query counts but not legacy provider-attempt notes. Paired total Telem/Tavily HTTP attempts and credits are not measured in this report; no total-work savings claim is supported.",
    "Supplemental real custom-board creation observed one Telem batch HTTP attempt, one direct Tavily HTTP attempt, one model call, and zero reported Tavily credits. This is separate from the paired run and not a billing audit.",
    "The missing source returned 422 SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE. Failure responses omit provider-attempt ledgers; work/cost on that failed operation is unknown, never zero.",
    "The fixture baseline has six expected oracle mismatches for refresh-all recomputation sets (R01,R02,R03,R05,R08,R09); treatment passed all ten. These are synthetic regression cases, not live savings.",
    "The independent browser gate passed only localhost in this task. HTTPS browser/sponsor/MCP release gates and native-client invocation remain controller-owned and unverified."
